# The demo board.
#
# This is a redirect, not a rewrite. Cloudflare Pages canonicalises /index.html
# to /, so a `/demo /index.html 200` rewrite is served as a 308 to / and the demo
# never loads. Redirecting to the query form is the shape Pages actually honours,
# so /demo is the address people type and /?demo is where they land.
/demo/ /?demo 301
/demo /?demo 301
